  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Sector Deepening Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSD Ethiopia works to build inclusive, sustainable, and resilient financial markets by turning financial sector reforms into real market activity. The programme focuses on strengthening the enabling environment, supporting investment-ready companies, mobilising domestic investors, and developing new financial instruments so that capital markets can actively channel long-term finance into Ethiopia&#x2019;s economic transformation, private sector growth, and climate-resilient development.</narrative>
  </description>
